# Active Development Policy

This project is **pre-alpha until v0.2.0+**. It is in **fast-paced
development** and breaking changes are expected.

Until v0.2.0+, backward compatibility, shims, legacy schema support, and
migration code are **neither required nor permitted**.

## Do Not

- Add legacy migration code, upgrade paths, or data backfill for old schemas
- Write compatibility shims, deprecated aliases, or wrappers for old API shapes, options, or config keys
- Keep legacy schema support alongside the current design
- Add dual code paths for old vs new designs

## Do

- Model the **current correct** API and behavior
- Change exported APIs directly when the design improves; consumers update in lockstep
- Prefer correctness over backward compatibility

## Database

- SQLite remains a supported database in this library alongside PostgreSQL.
  The PostgreSQL-only policy of the cyphix apps does not apply here.
